    ns34:test_oxigraph_backend.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.integration.test_oxigraph_backend" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """tests/integration/test_oxigraph_backend.py

Integration tests for StarLayerGraph backed by Oxigraph via rdf-1.2 native mode.

Oxigraph speaks the final W3C RDF 1.2 <<( )>> syntax natively and returns
"type":"triple" in SPARQL JSON results.

Requires a running Oxigraph instance:
    docker run -d --name oxigraph-test -p 7878:7878 \\
      ghcr.io/oxigraph/oxigraph serve --location /data --bind 0.0.0.0:7878

Run:
    .venv/bin/pytest tests/integration/ -v""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_oxigraph_backend" ;
        ns2:declares ns41:TestOxigraphGraphUpdate, ns41:TestOxigraphDatasetUpdate, ns41:_clear_graph, ns41:TestOxigraphTrix12Parse, ns41:TestOxigraphDatasetTrig12Parse, ns41:sg_rdf11, ns41:TestOxigraphLen, ns41:TestOxigraphGraphUpdateRdf11Mode, ns41:TestOxigraphIsomorphicAndSerialize, ns41:_make_store, ns41:TestOxigraphDatasetQuery, ns41:TestOxigraphTurtle12Parse, ns41:TestOxigraphNq12Parse, ns41:_clear_all, ns41:TestOxigraphRemove, ns41:_oxigraph_available, ns41:TestOxigraphNt12Parse, ns41:TestOxigraphBoundBnodeQuery, ns41:TestOxigraphRoundTrip, ns41:TestOxigraphTriplesChoices, ns41:TestOxigraphReconnect, ns41:TestOxigraphAddN, ns41:TestOxigraphRdfxml12Parse, ns41:TestOxigraphSPARQL, ns41:TestOxigraphRdf12SparqlFunctions, ns41:sg, ns41:TestOxigraphReificationAPI, ns41:TestOxigraphRdf11BlankNodes ;
