  - SELECT with variable triple-term pattern across multiple graphs
  - SELECT with SUBJECT/PREDICATE/OBJECT accessor functions inside GRAPH blocks
  - SELECT with isTRIPLE() filter
  - CONSTRUCT query
  - ASK query
