GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_manchester_serializer.py> {
    ns45:test_manchester_serializer.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_manchester_serializer" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Unit tests for starlayer.graph.serializers.manchester.

The primary correctness check throughout is round-tripping: parse known-good
Manchester text (via the already-tested parse_manchester), serialize it back,
re-parse the result, and assert the two graphs are isomorphic. This checks
two things at once - the serializer's RDF-shape recognition is correct, and
its output is itself genuinely valid, re-parseable Manchester syntax - and
matches the oracle-adjacent verification style used throughout this parser/
serializer's development (see manchester.py's own docstring for the same
technique applied against the real OWL API parser, ad hoc and uncommitted).

A handful of scoped-out reconstructions (SuperClassOf:/SuperPropertyOf:
always come back as SubClassOf:/SubPropertyOf:, onlysome always comes back
expanded, Misc EquivalentClasses:/SameIndividual:/binary DisjointClasses:
always come back as per-frame clauses) are asserted by their actual RDF
shape, not by expecting the identical keyword back - see manchester.py's
docstring for why those specific reconstructions aren't attempted.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_manchester_serializer" ;
        ns2:declares ns92:TestInlineAxiomAnnotationsRoundTrip, ns92:TestIndividualClausesRoundTrip, ns92:TestPrefixesAndNames, ns92:TestFramesRoundTrip, ns92:TestPropertyClausesRoundTrip, ns92:assert_round_trips, ns92:parse, ns92:TestErrors, ns92:ex, ns92:TestClassExpressionsRoundTrip, ns92:round_trip, ns92:TestDataRangesRoundTrip, ns92:TestMiscAxiomsRoundTrip, ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_manchester_serializer.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:pytest, ns4:rdflib.namespace, ns4:rdflib .

    ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_manchester_serializer.TestClassClausesRoundTrip" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
        rdfs:label "TestClassClausesRoundTrip" ;
        ns2:declares ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_subclassof_multiple, ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_superclassof_comes_back_as_subclassof, ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_disjointunionof, ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_haskey, ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_frame_level_annotations ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_manchester_serializer.py" ;
        ns2:lineEnd 111 ;
        ns2:lineStart 89 .

    ns92:TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_disjointunionof dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_manchester_serializer.TestClassClausesRoundTrip.test_disjointunionof" ;
        a ns2:Method ;
