GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_parsers_r4.py> {
    ns45:test_parsers_r4.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_parsers_r4" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Parser and serializer remainders of GitHub issues #73, #93, #99 and #128 (round 4), plus the TAB side finding.

Where plain rdflib can act as an oracle (Turtle 1.1 / N-Triples text), the test also checks that rdflib rejects the same input;
a case where rdflib is lenient is marked, and the grammar (Turtle 1.2 / N-Triples 1.2 / TriG 1.2) is the arbiter.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_parsers_r4" ;
