    ns45:test_skolem_semantics.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_skolem_semantics" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """skolem_semantics.rewrite(): isBLANK / isIRI / ORDER BY must give the same
answers over skolem IRIs as the original query gives over real blank nodes.

Checked by running the ORIGINAL query on a graph holding real blank nodes and
the REWRITTEN query on an identical graph in which every blank node has been
replaced by its skolem IRI, then comparing the results with skolem IRIs mapped
back to blank nodes. No server involved - rdflib evaluates both.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_skolem_semantics" ;
        ns2:declares ns118:_norm, ns118:test_text_without_those_constructs_is_unchanged, ns118:_graphs, ns118:test_skolem_iris_behave_like_blank_nodes, ns118:test_iri_containing_hash_or_angle_text_is_not_mangled ;
