GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/graph/vendor/spec_snapshots/refresh_snapshots.py> {
    ns152:refresh_snapshots.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.vendor.spec_snapshots.refresh_snapshots" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """tests/vendor/spec_snapshots/refresh_snapshots.py

Re-fetches the current W3C RDF 1.2 / SPARQL 1.2 spec documents and overwrites
the local .txt snapshots in this directory. Run this, then `git diff
tests/vendor/spec_snapshots/` to see exactly what changed in the spec text since the
last snapshot - the whole point of keeping these files (see README.md).

Requires: pip install html2text (dev-only, not a project dependency)

Run from anywhere:
    python3 tests/vendor/spec_snapshots/refresh_snapshots.py""" ;
        rdfs:label "refresh_snapshots" ;
        ns2:declares ns153:fetch, ns153:main ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/graph/vendor/spec_snapshots/refresh_snapshots.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:os, ns4:subprocess, ns4:re, ns4:urllib.request .

    ns153:fetch dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.vendor.spec_snapshots.refresh_snapshots.fetch" ;
        a ns2:Function ;
