GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_shape_fragments_paper.py> {
    ns163:test_shape_fragments_paper.py dcterms:identifier "tests.shacl.integration.test_shape_fragments_paper" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """``extract_subgraph()`` against the Shape Fragments paper (Delva, Dimou, Jakubowski, Van den Bussche, arXiv 2112.11796) and
its W3C-style companion specification (github.com/Shape-Fragments/shape-fragments-spec). GitHub issue #11.

The paper's Conformance Theorem: the fragment of a graph that conforms to a shapes graph itself conforms to it. A fragment
holds the target triples too, so the check here keeps each focus node as an explicit ``sh:targetNode`` and asks whether it
still conforms *inside* the fragment (without that, a fragment that dropped the targets would pass vacuously: its nodes
are no longer targeted). The cases are the paper's own examples plus one per constructor Table 2 defines.

Until 2026-10-23 four of them failed (class evidence and ``sh:not`` were not extracted) and the target triples were left
out. They are fixed, and these tests are the oracle that keeps the theorem true: a fixed example set, cases for what
only shows up when several shapes' fragments are unioned, and a randomized check.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_shape_fragments_paper" ;
        ns2:declares ns236:_conforms, ns236:_with_focus_targets, ns236:_case, ns236:test_a_node_that_is_not_a_target_contributes_nothing, ns236:_lit, ns236:test_the_fragment_holds_the_target_triples, ns236:_constraint, ns236:test_class_evidence_is_the_paper_neighborhood, ns236:_fragment_conforms, ns236:test_the_conformance_theorem_holds_for_random_shapes_and_graphs, ns236:test_negation_keeps_the_evidence_that_makes_it_hold, ns236:test_an_objects_of_target_includes_the_triples_pointing_at_the_node, ns236:test_the_focus_node_still_conforms_inside_its_fragment, ns236:_graph, ns236:_fragment, ns236:test_a_subjects_of_target_includes_the_triples_with_that_predicate, ns236:test_a_node_target_has_no_target_triple, ns236:test_a_class_target_includes_the_subclass_chain_that_makes_the_node_a_member ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_shape_fragments_paper.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:pytest, ns4:re, ns4:warnings, ns4:hypothesis, ns4:rdflib .

