    ns163:test_triple_rule_import_order.py dcterms:identifier "tests.shacl.integration.test_triple_rule_import_order" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """rule_set= and include_source_rule_provenance= still apply to sh:TripleRule in a fresh process (GitHub issue #104).

Installing the TripleRule patch from register_native_components() replaced the function apply_rules() had just wrapped for
rule-set filtering and provenance, so both were silently ignored; the order only shows in a process that has not validated yet.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_triple_rule_import_order" ;
        ns2:declares ns247:test_rule_set_and_provenance_apply_to_triple_rules_in_a_fresh_process ;
