        rdfs:comment """Regression tests for the SKOS findings of GitHub issue #101 (third hunt).

Oracle: the SKOS Reference (https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/). S23 (related is symmetric), S25/S26
(narrower and narrowerTransitive are the inverses of broader and broaderTransitive), S27 (related is
disjoint with broaderTransitive), S44 (exactMatch is symmetric and transitive), S46 (exactMatch is
disjoint with broadMatch and relatedMatch), S13/S14 (labels), S36 (every memberList item is a member).""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_skos_hunt3" ;
        ns2:declares ns373:_conforms, ns373:test_entailed_disjointness_conflicts_are_reported, ns373:test_plain_literal_labels_are_allowed, ns373:test_ordered_collection_with_only_a_member_list_conforms, ns373:test_non_literal_pref_label_is_still_rejected, ns373:test_unrelated_relations_still_conform ;
